From 7a99dbca845df603ebc985b468dba76e806f6521 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicholas Polys <npolys@vt.edu>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:38:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Default render size to HD 720p (1280x720, 16:9); pin mcp<2

render_image, render_current_scene, x3dom_page and x3dom_starter now
default to 1280x720 (HD, 16:9) instead of 720x540 and 800x600 px (4:3),
via shared _DEFAULT_WIDTH/_DEFAULT_HEIGHT constants in tools/render.py.
Viewpoint fieldOfView spans the smaller display dimension, so the
default 0.7854 rad now gives a 72.7-degree horizontal view.

Also pin mcp<2: mcp 2.x removed mcp.server.fastmcp, which src/ imports,
so a fresh install or redeploy currently fails at import time.
---
 pyproject.toml       |  2 +-
 src/tools/prompts.py |  5 +++--
 src/tools/render.py  | 42 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 tests/test_render.py |  8 ++++++++
 4 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 5f15c63..16b0600 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@ version = "0.1.0"
